n- If it is not intentional, fix the product or test setup instead. Never mask\n  a real visual regression by blindly accepting a changed screenshot.\n\nwarning: Configured value for `approval_policy` is disallowed by requirements; falling back to required value OnRequest. Details: invalid value for `approval_policy`: `Never` is not in the allowed set [OnRequest, UnlessTrusted] (set by enterprise-managed requirements Codex Developers (8a9cace4-0b4b-4c93-a8d5-b33253d2d6e4))\ncodex\n{\"status\":\"pass\",\"summary\":\"I\u2019ll inspect the existing discovery deliverable and repository guidance, then create the feature model and game-design artefacts with focused structural validation.\",\"changed_files\":[],\"test_result\":\"\",\"evidence\":{\"agent_log\":\"\",\"adapter_log\":\"\",\"test_log\":\"\",\"browser_log\":\"\",\"screenshots\":[]},\"acceptance_results\":[],\"documentation\":{\"reviewed_files\":[],\"updated_files\":[],\"summary\":\"\"},\"known_limitations\":[],\"browser_coverage\":\"\",\"recommended_next_step\":\"complete\"}\nmcp: codebase-memory-mcp/get_architecture started\nmcp: codebase-memory-mcp/get_architecture (failed)\nuser cancelled MCP tool call\nexec\n/bin/zsh -lc \"rg --files projects/football-trivia-e2e | sed -n '1,160p'\" in /Users/simon/Dev/github/jakowicz/runbook-generator\n succeeded in 0ms:\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-game-design-bible.md\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/01-creative-direction.md\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-game-design-bible.json\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/04-audio-direction.md\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/00-domain-discovery.md\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/01-game-identity.md\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/04-asset-direction.md\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/implementation-catalogue-index.json\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/game-production-inventory.json\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/game-design-